name: Tarot Tycoon — tarot shop flood
author: corpus
description: >-
  Tarot Tycoon makes Tarot cards appear 4x more frequently in the shop. Tier-2 voucher:
  requires Tarot Merchant bought first, so the earliest practical target is Ante 2.
  RAG aliases: tarot flood, deck fixing, Fortune Teller scaling, Perkeo tarot copy.
deck: Red
stake: White
must:
  - voucher: TarotTycoon
    antes: [2]
    sources:
      shopItems: [0, 1, 2, 3]
should:
  - joker: FortuneTeller
    antes: [1, 2, 3]
    score: 45
  - joker: Cartomancer
    antes: [1, 2, 3]
    score: 35
  - joker: Perkeo
    antes: [1, 2, 3]
    score: 30
